1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:03:08,290
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:03:08,560 --> 00:03:11,000
I set everything up for Raiwin

3
00:03:11,080 --> 00:03:13,200
to use Hathaya's fame for the election.

4
00:03:13,280 --> 00:03:17,160
And you came along and ruined the whole plan.

5
00:03:17,240 --> 00:03:18,440
You!

6
00:03:18,520 --> 00:03:21,600
Since you chose to behave so disgracefully,

7
00:03:22,240 --> 00:03:23,920
go live with Ramil.

8
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:26,560
I'm not going to hold a wedding and let people look down on us.

9
00:03:26,640 --> 00:03:28,400
PREVIOUSLY

10
00:03:28,480 --> 00:03:30,840
My boss is a fan of yours.

11
00:03:30,920 --> 00:03:33,760
He saw your video and felt sorry for you. So he sent us

12
00:03:33,840 --> 00:03:36,120
to bring all this over to cheer you up.

13
00:03:36,200 --> 00:03:38,160
If Mr. Pichai finds out about this,

14
00:03:38,240 --> 00:03:40,040
Hathaya is the one who'll suffer. Get it?

15
00:03:43,480 --> 00:03:44,400
All right.

16
00:03:45,160 --> 00:03:47,200
If you have something to say to Hathaya,

17
00:03:47,280 --> 00:03:48,280
say it now.

18
00:03:49,280 --> 00:03:51,680
Hathaya,

19
00:03:51,760 --> 00:03:55,080
I'm sorry. I'm really sorry.

20
00:03:55,640 --> 00:03:57,200
I'm sorry.

21
00:03:58,120 --> 00:04:01,560
Hathaya, please forgive us.

22
00:04:02,400 --> 00:04:04,400
I'm not forgiving any of you.

23
00:04:11,480 --> 00:04:13,480
If Mr. Pichai had found out,

24
00:04:15,120 --> 00:04:18,320
I would've lost my job and been sent home.

25
00:04:19,720 --> 00:04:21,440
What did I do wrong?

26
00:04:28,960 --> 00:04:30,760
I came here to work

27
00:04:30,840 --> 00:04:33,200
and save money for my grandmother's treatment.

28
00:04:33,720 --> 00:04:36,520
I tried to do something good and help all of you.

29
00:04:38,920 --> 00:04:41,600
Why did you repay me like this?

30
00:04:51,920 --> 00:04:53,720
If everyone is going to be selfish,

31
00:04:55,040 --> 00:04:56,960
then I'll be selfish too.

32
00:04:58,080 --> 00:05:00,200
From now on, we stay out of each other's lives.

33
00:05:01,240 --> 00:05:03,000
I'm not helping anyone anymore.

34
00:05:05,480 --> 00:05:09,120
Hathaya, I'm sorry! I'm really sorry. Hathaya.

35
00:05:12,560 --> 00:05:14,000
I'm sorry.

36
00:05:14,520 --> 00:05:17,840
I'm sorry from the bottom of my heart.

37
00:05:20,680 --> 00:05:23,360
We're not going to wait for you to forgive us.

38
00:05:24,560 --> 00:05:27,720
But we're going to show you

39
00:05:28,360 --> 00:05:30,160
that we're not selfish.

40
00:05:31,440 --> 00:05:35,000
We'll show everyone that we're not garbage.

41
00:05:36,240 --> 00:05:37,280
We're not a burden.

42
00:05:38,400 --> 00:05:39,920
And we're going to become

43
00:05:40,960 --> 00:05:42,520
better people than we were before.

44
00:05:42,600 --> 00:05:45,040
-I'm sorry. -I'm sorry…

45
00:05:45,560 --> 00:05:46,440
I'm truly sorry.

46
00:05:46,960 --> 00:05:49,360
-Hathaya. -I'm sorry…

47
00:05:49,440 --> 00:05:51,520
-I'm sorry. -I'm sorry.

48
00:05:51,600 --> 00:05:54,040
-I'm sorry. -Hathaya.

49
00:05:55,120 --> 00:05:56,720
I'm sorry…

50
00:06:01,800 --> 00:06:03,800
Max. Let's go.

51
00:06:14,400 --> 00:06:15,720
I'll wait.

52
00:06:18,000 --> 00:06:20,040
I'll wait to see all of you succeed.

53
00:06:25,680 --> 00:06:28,960
Hathaya! I'm sorry!

54
00:06:29,040 --> 00:06:30,080
I'm sorry.

55
00:06:30,160 --> 00:06:32,480
-I'm sorry. -Please forgive us.

56
00:06:32,560 --> 00:06:35,080
-I'm truly sorry, Hathaya. -I'm sorry.

57
00:06:40,680 --> 00:06:41,920
Hey.

58
00:06:43,040 --> 00:06:44,400
Thank you.

59
00:06:45,680 --> 00:06:47,880
Thank you for helping me get through that.

60
00:06:49,720 --> 00:06:51,000
You don't have to thank me.

61
00:06:51,600 --> 00:06:53,120
My workers messed up.

62
00:06:53,200 --> 00:06:56,160
As their supervisor, it was my job to fix it.

63
00:06:57,200 --> 00:06:58,960
I still have to thank you.

64
00:06:59,720 --> 00:07:02,000
If you had chosen the workers yourself,

65
00:07:02,080 --> 00:07:04,720
you probably could've found better-qualified people.

66
00:07:05,480 --> 00:07:08,680
But instead, you chose to help them and give them a chance.

67
00:07:10,160 --> 00:07:11,360
And look what happened.

68
00:07:12,440 --> 00:07:14,280
After this,

69
00:07:14,960 --> 00:07:16,880
are you still gonna give anyone else a chance?

70
00:07:19,400 --> 00:07:21,080
I'm not sure.

71
00:07:21,160 --> 00:07:23,440
But someone like you

72
00:07:24,320 --> 00:07:27,120
would never just stand by and watch someone suffer.

73
00:07:30,280 --> 00:07:32,040
You're just like your grandmother.

74
00:07:34,240 --> 00:07:36,240
You know my grandmother?

75
00:07:42,000 --> 00:07:44,840
-Uh… -You said that like you know her.

76
00:07:47,000 --> 00:07:50,720
You came here to work and earn money for your grandmother's treatment.

77
00:07:50,800 --> 00:07:54,320
So I figured you probably grew up

78
00:07:54,400 --> 00:07:56,080
listening to her teachings. Right?

79
00:07:57,640 --> 00:07:58,680
Come on.

80
00:08:18,640 --> 00:08:21,280
DUANGJAI'S FOOD STALL

81
00:08:21,360 --> 00:08:23,080
Seafood gravy noodles for you.

82
00:08:23,160 --> 00:08:24,600
Thank you.

83
00:08:24,680 --> 00:08:27,120
My dear chef,

84
00:08:27,200 --> 00:08:31,160
give me spicy minced pork basil with two runny fried eggs.

85
00:08:31,760 --> 00:08:33,159
Oh, Hathai.

86
00:08:33,240 --> 00:08:35,600
Come sit down. I'll make it for you.

87
00:08:35,679 --> 00:08:38,720
Sure, Mom. Make it two plates.

88
00:08:38,799 --> 00:08:40,280
Wow.

89
00:08:40,360 --> 00:08:43,640
Have you been starving yourself? You're eating two plates by yourself?

90
00:08:46,520 --> 00:08:50,040
Mom, this is Big, my husband.

91
00:08:50,120 --> 00:08:51,280
Say hello to him.

92
00:08:53,920 --> 00:08:56,840
Mom, don't be silly just because Hathai told you to. Hello.

93
00:08:56,920 --> 00:08:58,480
Okay.

94
00:09:01,240 --> 00:09:03,400
So, Mom? What do you think?

95
00:09:03,920 --> 00:09:04,960
Impressed?

96
00:09:06,560 --> 00:09:09,520
Yes, yes. Wait a moment. I'll make the food.

97
00:09:29,760 --> 00:09:33,240
What are you doing here? Shouldn't you be with customers?

98
00:09:33,320 --> 00:09:37,000
I came to make sure Wit and Aow actually showed up for work.

99
00:09:38,320 --> 00:09:40,600
And what if they didn't?

100
00:09:40,680 --> 00:09:44,160
Then I'll have to fire them. And I'll have to take responsibility too.

101
00:09:46,480 --> 00:09:48,880
They really didn't come to work.

102
00:09:51,880 --> 00:09:52,800
Wait.

103
00:09:52,880 --> 00:09:54,000
Where are you going?

104
00:09:54,080 --> 00:09:55,640
To go get them.

105
00:09:56,600 --> 00:09:57,680
Come here.

106
00:10:05,920 --> 00:10:07,040
Here.

107
00:10:07,120 --> 00:10:10,040
I had them help here first. Then they'll head back to their site.

108
00:10:15,800 --> 00:10:17,280
So…

109
00:10:18,240 --> 00:10:20,080
I got here early.

110
00:10:20,760 --> 00:10:23,240
They actually started two hours early today.

111
00:10:24,560 --> 00:10:27,720
All right, everyone! Keep up the good work.

112
00:10:27,800 --> 00:10:29,360
I'll let you leave early today.

113
00:10:29,440 --> 00:10:30,600
That's all right, boss.

114
00:10:30,680 --> 00:10:33,960
We'd rather finish at the usual time. Consider it our apology.

115
00:10:34,600 --> 00:10:36,400
Mr. Pichai wants the project completed faster.

116
00:10:36,480 --> 00:10:40,000
We all talked it over and decided to start work earlier from now on.

117
00:10:40,080 --> 00:10:42,720
-That's right. -Yes.

118
00:10:42,800 --> 00:10:45,560
We want to see Mr. Pichai happy, and we want him to appreciate you

119
00:10:45,640 --> 00:10:47,080
and Hathaya too.

120
00:10:47,800 --> 00:10:50,240
All right. If you can handle it, fine.

121
00:10:50,320 --> 00:10:53,160
Then I'll pay you overtime.

122
00:10:53,240 --> 00:10:56,160
No need, boss. We want to help.

123
00:10:56,240 --> 00:10:58,880
-That's right. -Yes.

124
00:10:58,960 --> 00:11:01,680
Thank you for your kindness, everyone.

125
00:11:01,760 --> 00:11:03,920
But if you put in the work,

126
00:11:04,000 --> 00:11:06,640
you deserve fair pay for it.

127
00:11:06,720 --> 00:11:08,200
Still, thank you.

128
00:11:08,280 --> 00:11:09,240
-Yes. -Yes.

129
00:11:09,320 --> 00:11:10,800
Yes.

130
00:11:24,440 --> 00:11:26,600
Now that you've seen how hard they're working,

131
00:11:27,120 --> 00:11:28,800
you can stop worrying.

132
00:11:30,040 --> 00:11:34,080
I'm glad they came to their senses. I don't want them going back

133
00:11:34,160 --> 00:11:36,400
to wandering around like parasites.

134
00:11:38,640 --> 00:11:42,520
Ms. Liu keeps calling you a parasite.

135
00:11:43,040 --> 00:11:45,880
Is that why you sympathize with them?

136
00:11:46,960 --> 00:11:48,800
Nobody wants to be looked down on.

137
00:11:49,320 --> 00:11:51,440
Everyone wants to be proud of themselves.

138
00:11:53,160 --> 00:11:56,480
But I have to admit, I still need someone to rely on.

139
00:11:57,000 --> 00:11:59,320
In other people's eyes, I'm still a parasite.

140
00:12:00,360 --> 00:12:04,720
But one day, I'm going to become a strong, fully grown tree.

141
00:12:05,360 --> 00:12:06,920
I'll stand on my own.

142
00:12:14,200 --> 00:12:15,240
Aren't you going to work?

143
00:12:15,840 --> 00:12:18,760
Right. I'm going to work.

144
00:12:18,840 --> 00:12:20,120
Sure.

145
00:12:20,200 --> 00:12:21,800
-Hey! -Oops!

146
00:12:24,720 --> 00:12:25,960
You're going…

147
00:12:28,880 --> 00:12:29,880
that way.

148
00:12:31,200 --> 00:12:32,640
Oh. Wrong way.

149
00:12:34,040 --> 00:12:34,880
I'm going.

150
00:12:34,960 --> 00:12:36,400
I'm going that way?

151
00:12:36,480 --> 00:12:38,200
-Yes. -Right?

152
00:12:39,480 --> 00:12:40,560
Bye.

153
00:12:42,640 --> 00:12:44,160
-I'm going. -Bye.

154
00:12:49,480 --> 00:12:50,320
HOME FOR SALE FROM 4.8M BAHT

155
00:13:12,280 --> 00:13:14,920
You should get to work.

156
00:13:15,960 --> 00:13:17,720
I'm going.

157
00:13:18,920 --> 00:13:20,000
Good luck.

158
00:13:20,080 --> 00:13:21,960
Watch out.

159
00:13:38,760 --> 00:13:40,680
Want some fruit?

160
00:13:40,760 --> 00:13:43,840
DUANGJAI'S FOOD STALL

161
00:13:44,520 --> 00:13:46,880
Next time you come, stay at home.

162
00:13:46,960 --> 00:13:48,800
No need to waste money staying elsewhere.

163
00:13:48,880 --> 00:13:51,960
Mom, don't worry.

164
00:13:52,040 --> 00:13:56,040
Big has a place that's much more comfortable and luxurious than our house.

165
00:13:56,760 --> 00:13:59,120
Don't think I'm being nosy.

166
00:14:00,240 --> 00:14:01,560
What do you do for work?

167
00:14:04,080 --> 00:14:07,720
Mom! That's rude. Who asks something like that?

168
00:14:07,800 --> 00:14:09,440
I want to know.

169
00:14:09,520 --> 00:14:13,160
Every husband you've had has either been broke or ended up in jail.

170
00:14:13,240 --> 00:14:14,560
Mom!

171
00:14:16,080 --> 00:14:17,040
I'm in business.

172
00:14:17,920 --> 00:14:18,960
What kind of business?

173
00:14:20,520 --> 00:14:24,480
Oh, Mom. You're giving me a headache.

174
00:14:25,720 --> 00:14:26,560
Trading.

175
00:14:26,640 --> 00:14:27,760
That's good.

176
00:14:27,840 --> 00:14:30,560
You own your own business. What do you sell?

177
00:14:30,640 --> 00:14:32,320
Mom!

178
00:14:32,400 --> 00:14:33,360
Auntie,

179
00:14:33,440 --> 00:14:34,600
can I pay?

180
00:14:35,160 --> 00:14:36,800
-We'll continue this conversation. -Yes.

181
00:14:39,520 --> 00:14:40,840
Fifty baht.

182
00:14:44,280 --> 00:14:45,400
Thank you.

183
00:14:54,440 --> 00:14:55,560
Mom,

184
00:14:55,640 --> 00:14:58,360
I'm leaving my husband with you for a minute. I'll be right back.

185
00:14:58,440 --> 00:14:59,800
Where are you going?

186
00:15:01,360 --> 00:15:02,600
To find a new husband.

187
00:15:04,360 --> 00:15:05,960
Just kidding, Mom.

188
00:15:06,040 --> 00:15:08,920
I'm going to buy dessert for my husband.

189
00:15:09,000 --> 00:15:13,000
Whenever he eats something savory, he has to finish with something sweet.

190
00:15:13,640 --> 00:15:16,960
Watch him for me. And don't secretly eat my husband.

191
00:15:17,040 --> 00:15:18,920
You little…

192
00:15:20,920 --> 00:15:22,840
So what exactly do you sell?

193
00:15:24,520 --> 00:15:25,440
Clams.

194
00:15:26,640 --> 00:15:27,800
Oh?

195
00:15:27,880 --> 00:15:31,600
So do you sell squid, shrimp, all kinds of seafood?

196
00:15:33,000 --> 00:15:35,120
No. Just clams.

197
00:15:36,000 --> 00:15:36,920
I see.

198
00:15:37,880 --> 00:15:41,200
Next time, bring me a kilo or two.

199
00:15:41,840 --> 00:15:42,800
Sure.

200
00:15:48,960 --> 00:15:52,240
Hey, you.

201
00:15:53,600 --> 00:15:55,920
My name is Hathai.

202
00:15:56,000 --> 00:15:58,240
I'm Aunt Duangjai's daughter from the food stall.

203
00:15:59,720 --> 00:16:01,320
I've heard about you.

204
00:16:02,840 --> 00:16:05,640
They told you I'm the prettiest woman in the neighborhood, right?

205
00:16:07,800 --> 00:16:12,280
They said debt collectors beat you up, so you ran away and went somewhere else.

206
00:16:16,080 --> 00:16:20,600
Oh, people will gossip about anything.

207
00:16:23,320 --> 00:16:26,400
Here's the thing. I'm expanding into a new business.

208
00:16:26,480 --> 00:16:29,360
I'd like to invite you to come work for me.

209
00:16:29,440 --> 00:16:31,920
It's good work and good money.

210
00:16:32,000 --> 00:16:34,640
You can bring your friends too.

211
00:16:34,720 --> 00:16:37,800
I'm looking for girls who are pretty, have good figures,

212
00:16:37,880 --> 00:16:39,640
and look clean and presentable.

213
00:16:41,280 --> 00:16:43,120
What kind of work do you do?

214
00:16:47,840 --> 00:16:48,800
Of course.

215
00:16:48,880 --> 00:16:52,160
Once everything is settled, I'll call you back.

216
00:16:52,240 --> 00:16:54,280
Yes. Yes.

217
00:17:09,920 --> 00:17:11,040
Boss,

218
00:17:11,119 --> 00:17:14,359
with this many house reservations, you'd better finish construction on time.

219
00:17:14,440 --> 00:17:17,200
If you don't, the customers are going to burn our office down.

220
00:17:17,839 --> 00:17:20,720
With the workers working this hard, we'll finish on time.

221
00:17:21,319 --> 00:17:22,880
You've built houses

222
00:17:23,400 --> 00:17:25,200
for so many people.

223
00:17:25,720 --> 00:17:27,520
Ever thought of building your own marital home?

224
00:17:29,200 --> 00:17:30,440
Who would want me?

225
00:17:31,080 --> 00:17:32,800
That's true, boss.

226
00:17:33,360 --> 00:17:36,640
You're rough, and your mouth is filthy.

227
00:17:36,720 --> 00:17:38,760
No woman could put up with you.

228
00:17:43,280 --> 00:17:45,400
You scared me! Sorry.

229
00:17:50,640 --> 00:17:51,680
Hello, sir.

230
00:17:53,600 --> 00:17:56,520
I bought you some of your favorite snacks. I got plenty.

231
00:17:57,200 --> 00:17:58,200
Share with the workers too.

232
00:17:58,280 --> 00:17:59,520
Thank you.

233
00:18:00,640 --> 00:18:01,680
Wow.

234
00:18:02,840 --> 00:18:05,000
I saw you've already built several houses.

235
00:18:06,200 --> 00:18:07,440
My son is really talented.

236
00:18:08,120 --> 00:18:10,280
Once I save up a hundred million,

237
00:18:10,360 --> 00:18:12,400
-you'll oversee my house construction-- -Max, go work.

238
00:18:12,480 --> 00:18:14,880
Go.

239
00:18:14,960 --> 00:18:15,920
Max.

240
00:18:16,000 --> 00:18:18,960
Send some workers to plaster Zone B.

241
00:18:19,040 --> 00:18:20,480
Yes. Boss.

242
00:18:20,560 --> 00:18:22,000
Hey,

243
00:18:22,640 --> 00:18:25,480
your dad really did buy your favorite stuff.

244
00:18:26,120 --> 00:18:27,160
I'm not eating it.

245
00:18:28,080 --> 00:18:28,920
Why not?

246
00:18:29,960 --> 00:18:30,880
Go.

247
00:18:31,400 --> 00:18:32,760
Ramil.

248
00:18:35,440 --> 00:18:36,440
Miss Hathaya,

249
00:18:37,040 --> 00:18:39,000
please give this to Ramil for me.

250
00:18:39,920 --> 00:18:41,200
I'm going back to work.

251
00:18:49,400 --> 00:18:52,720
I won't keep you long. Just give me five minutes.

252
00:18:56,280 --> 00:18:57,800
Last time you took my money,

253
00:18:58,600 --> 00:19:00,840
you said you'd pay me back once you made a profit.

254
00:19:02,680 --> 00:19:03,760
Give it to me.

255
00:19:07,680 --> 00:19:10,880
Ramil, I'm sorry. They cheated me out of both

256
00:19:12,040 --> 00:19:13,400
my investment and the profits.

257
00:19:14,240 --> 00:19:15,640
I lost everything.

258
00:19:15,720 --> 00:19:18,920
I warned you. You never listen.

259
00:19:22,400 --> 00:19:24,560
Every time I lend you money,

260
00:19:25,480 --> 00:19:28,520
I hope you'll make a profit and pay me back,

261
00:19:28,600 --> 00:19:31,280
but that never happens. You only come back asking to borrow more.

262
00:19:32,520 --> 00:19:34,760
Ramil, things can go wrong.

263
00:19:35,360 --> 00:19:37,480
And I'm not doing any of this for myself.

264
00:19:37,560 --> 00:19:39,480
I'm doing it for you and your mother.

265
00:19:40,920 --> 00:19:42,800
I want to see our family live comfortably.

266
00:19:42,880 --> 00:19:44,640
Please.

267
00:19:44,720 --> 00:19:47,680
Stop using me and Mom as an excuse.

268
00:19:47,760 --> 00:19:49,400
Stop thinking about us.

269
00:19:50,680 --> 00:19:52,680
Just do something that lets you support yourself

270
00:19:52,760 --> 00:19:54,200
without borrowing my money again.

271
00:20:00,360 --> 00:20:01,480
Okay.

272
00:20:02,920 --> 00:20:04,440
If you think I'm a burden,

273
00:20:06,600 --> 00:20:08,040
I won't bother you anymore.

274
00:20:10,320 --> 00:20:11,480
I'll find my own way.

275
00:20:51,640 --> 00:20:53,400
Your father bought these for you.

276
00:20:55,800 --> 00:20:57,040
Take them.

277
00:21:04,720 --> 00:21:06,840
It's not that I want to be an ungrateful son,

278
00:21:08,000 --> 00:21:10,040
but every time I give him money,

279
00:21:10,960 --> 00:21:12,640
he loses all of it.

280
00:21:15,520 --> 00:21:17,280
I'm sorry.

281
00:21:18,320 --> 00:21:22,680
I misunderstood you. I thought you were heartless toward your dad.

282
00:21:24,640 --> 00:21:26,680
With a father like that, you have to be firm.

283
00:21:27,600 --> 00:21:29,480
That's why I keep my savings with Mom.

284
00:21:33,160 --> 00:21:34,840
I'm saving to build a house.

285
00:21:36,200 --> 00:21:39,760
A home where Mom and Dad can live together again.

286
00:21:42,280 --> 00:21:44,800
I hope you achieve that soon.

287
00:21:44,880 --> 00:21:46,480
I hope you can build that house soon.

288
00:21:47,920 --> 00:21:49,560
I've already saved quite a lot.

289
00:21:49,640 --> 00:21:52,440
Another year or so, and I should have enough.

290
00:21:54,120 --> 00:21:57,720
But I'm glad your father didn't make a huge scene today.

291
00:21:57,800 --> 00:21:59,560
I don't like seeing the two of you fight.

292
00:22:05,880 --> 00:22:07,040
That's strange.

293
00:22:08,120 --> 00:22:11,720
Normally, if Dad doesn't get money, he never leaves this easily.

294
00:22:19,120 --> 00:22:20,120
Unless…

295
00:22:23,600 --> 00:22:24,560
Ramil.

296
00:22:30,360 --> 00:22:31,560
DUANGJAI'S FOOD STALL

297
00:22:31,640 --> 00:22:33,640
Honey.

298
00:22:33,720 --> 00:22:35,680
Let's go.

299
00:22:35,760 --> 00:22:39,440
I thought you went to buy dessert. You didn't bring back a single bag.

300
00:22:41,680 --> 00:22:42,520
Uh…

301
00:22:43,040 --> 00:22:45,080
I changed my mind, Mom.

302
00:22:45,160 --> 00:22:48,080
I thought I'd let him have me for dessert instead.

303
00:22:48,160 --> 00:22:50,480
I'm much tastier than desserts.

304
00:22:50,560 --> 00:22:52,000
Ugh.

305
00:22:53,360 --> 00:22:55,640
-Come on, honey. -Let's go.

306
00:22:57,000 --> 00:22:58,400
Bye, Mom.

307
00:23:04,440 --> 00:23:05,800
Can you give me your number?

308
00:23:05,880 --> 00:23:07,040
Yes.

309
00:23:25,320 --> 00:23:27,760
Ploy, what did my daughter say to you?

310
00:23:28,720 --> 00:23:30,360
She wants to hire me and my friends.

311
00:23:31,640 --> 00:23:33,400
Oh, her husband's business?

312
00:23:33,480 --> 00:23:35,560
Which market does he want you to sell at?

313
00:23:38,000 --> 00:23:39,200
Why would I work at a market?

314
00:23:39,280 --> 00:23:41,920
Because Hathai's husband sells clams.

315
00:23:46,680 --> 00:23:47,600
Auntie…

316
00:24:08,440 --> 00:24:11,280
Mom! Don't transfer any money to Dad!

317
00:24:16,000 --> 00:24:16,920
Dad.

318
00:24:17,560 --> 00:24:19,000
Give the money back.

319
00:24:19,080 --> 00:24:20,920
I didn't take your money.

320
00:24:22,040 --> 00:24:23,000
I asked your Mom for it.

321
00:24:23,520 --> 00:24:26,560
But that is my money. I saved it to build a house for Mom.

322
00:24:26,640 --> 00:24:29,000
Ramil, you don't have to rush to build a house.

323
00:24:29,080 --> 00:24:31,440
Five million will only build a small house.

324
00:24:31,520 --> 00:24:33,600
If I invest it, the returns will be much better.

325
00:24:34,400 --> 00:24:35,560
Give it back.

326
00:24:35,640 --> 00:24:37,640
Give it back. Give it back.

327
00:24:37,720 --> 00:24:39,400
Ramil!

328
00:24:39,480 --> 00:24:40,680
That's enough!

329
00:24:41,640 --> 00:24:42,680
Ramil, listen to me.

330
00:24:43,480 --> 00:24:45,240
This friend's known me since high school.

331
00:24:45,880 --> 00:24:47,480
He's a good man, and he's capable.

332
00:24:47,560 --> 00:24:50,480
This definitely isn't a Ponzi scheme or network marketing.

333
00:24:50,560 --> 00:24:54,280
He's building a seafood factory to sell online domestically and internationally.

334
00:24:55,480 --> 00:24:58,960
In less than a year, I'll pay you back a hundred times over.

335
00:25:02,320 --> 00:25:03,440
Ramil!

336
00:25:04,120 --> 00:25:05,200
Don't.

337
00:25:06,560 --> 00:25:08,200
If you don't pay me back,

338
00:25:11,200 --> 00:25:13,160
don't ever show your face to me again.

339
00:25:18,640 --> 00:25:20,240
I hate you.

340
00:25:48,320 --> 00:25:49,320
Sir.

341
00:25:53,480 --> 00:25:55,000
This is a family matter.

342
00:25:55,520 --> 00:25:58,520
It has nothing to do with you. Don't try to stop me.

343
00:26:00,320 --> 00:26:01,920
I'm not trying to stop you.

344
00:26:02,800 --> 00:26:06,200
I have no right to interfere in your personal issues with Ramil.

345
00:26:08,280 --> 00:26:10,160
I just wanted to tell you

346
00:26:10,240 --> 00:26:13,680
that Ramil spent his entire life saving that money.

347
00:26:14,640 --> 00:26:15,880
He wants to build a house.

348
00:26:18,320 --> 00:26:21,480
A home where his father, mother, and him can all live together as a family.

349
00:26:23,480 --> 00:26:27,000
Ramil is waiting for you to come back and live with them.

350
00:26:37,840 --> 00:26:41,040
Ramil, don't dwell on it, sweetheart.

351
00:26:41,120 --> 00:26:43,000
We can save the money again.

352
00:26:47,480 --> 00:26:49,080
How could you do that, Mom?

353
00:26:50,960 --> 00:26:53,760
I spent my whole life saving that money, and you lent it to Dad

354
00:26:53,840 --> 00:26:55,200
without even asking me!

355
00:26:55,280 --> 00:26:58,680
But he promised this would be the last time.

356
00:26:59,600 --> 00:27:01,200
And he promised he'd pay it back.

357
00:27:01,280 --> 00:27:04,520
You know perfectly well he never keeps those promises.

358
00:27:04,600 --> 00:27:07,000
He wouldn't stop pressuring me.

359
00:27:07,640 --> 00:27:10,200
I didn't want Mr. Saksit to see him here.

360
00:27:10,720 --> 00:27:13,080
We're divorced, but it's still inappropriate.

361
00:27:13,600 --> 00:27:16,200
I didn't want Mr. Saksit to misunderstand.

362
00:27:16,720 --> 00:27:17,840
In the end,

363
00:27:20,280 --> 00:27:24,080
all you care about is your new husband. You never care about me!

364
00:27:30,600 --> 00:27:31,840
Of course I care about you.

365
00:27:32,520 --> 00:27:36,800
That's why I don't want you struggling. We don't need to build a house.

366
00:27:36,880 --> 00:27:38,600
We're fine living here.

367
00:27:38,680 --> 00:27:40,480
But I'm not fine living here, Mom!

368
00:27:42,080 --> 00:27:43,800
I don't want to be their servant.

369
00:27:44,680 --> 00:27:48,200
That's why I work so hard. I saved that money to build you a house.

370
00:27:49,760 --> 00:27:51,360
And you ruined everything.

371
00:27:54,320 --> 00:27:57,840
I used to hate Dad for abandoning us,

372
00:27:58,520 --> 00:28:00,080
causing nothing but problems

373
00:28:01,240 --> 00:28:02,640
and wasting our money.

374
00:28:04,040 --> 00:28:05,120
And now,

375
00:28:06,920 --> 00:28:08,920
I have to be disappointed in you too?

376
00:28:10,760 --> 00:28:12,440
You never do anything.

377
00:28:13,520 --> 00:28:15,160
You never protect me.

378
00:28:15,840 --> 00:28:18,720
You let your new husband and Dad keep hurting me.

379
00:28:21,320 --> 00:28:22,840
You're no different from them.

380
00:28:26,280 --> 00:28:27,440
I hate you.

381
00:28:28,520 --> 00:28:30,800
Ramil! Ramil, listen to me!

382
00:29:17,200 --> 00:29:20,760
If doing this makes you feel better,

383
00:29:22,120 --> 00:29:23,800
then keep doing it.

384
00:29:25,160 --> 00:29:26,400
Don't be sarcastic.

385
00:29:28,120 --> 00:29:29,440
I'm not.

386
00:29:32,120 --> 00:29:35,840
You want to let out your anger, so I'm letting you.

387
00:29:37,880 --> 00:29:39,240
But believe me.

388
00:29:41,160 --> 00:29:43,120
It won't actually make you feel better.

389
00:29:43,200 --> 00:29:44,760
Then what am I supposed to do?

390
00:29:46,120 --> 00:29:49,000
You saw everything I went through today.

391
00:29:50,200 --> 00:29:53,480
I've tried to do everything I can to make Mom's life better.

392
00:29:54,760 --> 00:29:58,040
So she wouldn't have to serve them or be their emotional punching bag.

393
00:30:00,080 --> 00:30:02,560
Have you ever told your mother

394
00:30:03,480 --> 00:30:04,920
how exhausted you are?

395
00:30:05,680 --> 00:30:08,200
Do I really have to say it out loud?

396
00:30:08,720 --> 00:30:11,600
Can't she see everything I do?

397
00:30:12,640 --> 00:30:13,760
But forget it.

398
00:30:14,880 --> 00:30:16,560
If she doesn't appreciate me,

399
00:30:16,640 --> 00:30:18,560
then from now on,

400
00:30:19,760 --> 00:30:21,680
I'll do everything for myself.

401
00:30:23,440 --> 00:30:24,960
I'm not caring about anyone anymore.

402
00:30:36,760 --> 00:30:38,960
-Have you been doing this long? -No, sir.

403
00:30:40,200 --> 00:30:42,160
You've been here since the afternoon.

404
00:30:43,040 --> 00:30:44,280
NOW HIRING: FEMALE SERVERS AND HOSTESSES

405
00:30:44,360 --> 00:30:45,560
GOOD INCOME FEMALE, AGE 18-30

406
00:30:50,840 --> 00:30:53,760
In the afternoon?

407
00:30:54,960 --> 00:30:57,680
Hathai. Why isn't she answering?

408
00:30:57,760 --> 00:30:58,960
Have you had something to eat?

409
00:31:04,040 --> 00:31:05,480
Where are you going?

410
00:31:05,560 --> 00:31:07,240
Inside, obviously.

411
00:31:07,320 --> 00:31:09,920
We only hire women under 30 here.

412
00:31:10,000 --> 00:31:10,840
Go home, Grandma.

413
00:31:10,920 --> 00:31:13,760
I'm not applying for a job. I'm looking for my daughter.

414
00:31:13,840 --> 00:31:16,160
Let your daughter work. Don't bother her.

415
00:31:16,240 --> 00:31:17,040
Go home.

416
00:31:17,120 --> 00:31:20,000
Why are you blocking me? I'm going in to see my daughter.

417
00:31:20,080 --> 00:31:21,640
-Don't you understand? -Mom!

418
00:31:24,800 --> 00:31:26,840
Go inside. She's my mother.

419
00:31:26,920 --> 00:31:27,960
Yes, boss.

420
00:31:30,120 --> 00:31:32,240
Mom. How did you even get here?

421
00:31:32,320 --> 00:31:33,800
I got here just fine.

422
00:31:34,360 --> 00:31:37,200
You stop this right now, or I'm calling the police.

423
00:31:39,880 --> 00:31:41,160
Come inside first.

424
00:31:42,280 --> 00:31:43,440
Come on.

425
00:31:48,960 --> 00:31:50,120
Hathai.

426
00:31:52,360 --> 00:31:54,400
That girl told me what kind of work

427
00:31:54,480 --> 00:31:56,080
you were recruiting her for.

428
00:31:56,680 --> 00:31:59,000
Mom, don't worry.

429
00:31:59,600 --> 00:32:02,120
I don't want you to do illegal work.

430
00:32:02,200 --> 00:32:03,680
Please find something else to do.

431
00:32:03,760 --> 00:32:04,920
Mom.

432
00:32:08,000 --> 00:32:11,000
Hathai, go take care of the customers.

433
00:32:11,960 --> 00:32:14,080
And don't let your mother cause trouble here.

434
00:32:27,320 --> 00:32:28,160
Mom.

435
00:32:29,840 --> 00:32:31,280
Please go home.

436
00:32:31,360 --> 00:32:33,920
I might not be able

437
00:32:34,000 --> 00:32:35,760
to visit you at the stall for a while.

438
00:32:36,280 --> 00:32:38,480
Take this money and use it.

439
00:32:38,560 --> 00:32:41,080
And don't come interfere here again.

440
00:32:42,520 --> 00:32:44,280
You keep doing your work.

441
00:32:44,880 --> 00:32:47,520
Don't let me become a burden to you.

442
00:32:48,440 --> 00:32:50,720
Whether I live or die,

443
00:32:50,800 --> 00:32:52,520
you don't have to care.

444
00:32:53,240 --> 00:32:56,080
Just let me die like a dog on the side of the road.

445
00:32:57,720 --> 00:32:59,520
Take your money back.

446
00:33:00,120 --> 00:33:02,040
I won't use dirty money.

447
00:33:39,440 --> 00:33:41,840
I'm trying my best, Mom.

448
00:33:45,800 --> 00:33:48,480
I want to earn money for your treatment.

449
00:33:49,240 --> 00:33:51,160
I want you to live comfortably.

450
00:34:05,080 --> 00:34:08,560
Sir, we're ready.

451
00:34:17,719 --> 00:34:20,480
Spirits who guard this house, and all sacred beings,

452
00:34:20,560 --> 00:34:24,080
please help Hathai change her mind.

453
00:34:27,840 --> 00:34:31,400
Please protect her too. Don't let the police arrest her.

454
00:35:00,440 --> 00:35:03,120
Miss Hathaya saw that you hadn't eaten anything,

455
00:35:03,640 --> 00:35:06,520
so she made food for you. I'm going to bed.

456
00:35:30,640 --> 00:35:32,720
Ramil. How are you? Feeling better?

457
00:35:33,680 --> 00:35:34,560
Huh?

458
00:35:34,640 --> 00:35:36,520
-Max. -Yes?

459
00:35:37,160 --> 00:35:39,160
Where's your boss?

460
00:35:39,240 --> 00:35:41,400
He's upstairs sleeping.

461
00:35:41,480 --> 00:35:43,760
He's off today, so he had me drive you.

462
00:35:44,360 --> 00:35:47,280
How is he? I'll prepare some medicine for him.

463
00:35:47,360 --> 00:35:49,760
From what I can tell, he seems normal.

464
00:35:49,840 --> 00:35:51,840
Then I'll go check on him.

465
00:35:51,920 --> 00:35:53,080
Oh.

466
00:35:53,600 --> 00:35:55,720
For your own safety, I wouldn't. Trust me.

467
00:35:58,680 --> 00:36:00,680
You should go.

468
00:36:01,480 --> 00:36:03,360
-Come on. -Okay.

469
00:36:05,360 --> 00:36:07,120
Miss Hathaya, come on.

470
00:36:07,200 --> 00:36:08,520
Let's go.

471
00:36:10,720 --> 00:36:12,000
I'll lock up. Let's go.

472
00:36:26,040 --> 00:36:27,840
Aunt Chamoi, please let me through.

473
00:36:27,920 --> 00:36:30,080
No can do.

474
00:36:30,160 --> 00:36:32,480
The path is closed.

475
00:36:33,440 --> 00:36:35,960
I really don't have time to play around with you.

476
00:36:37,200 --> 00:36:40,120
I said you can't go in. Orders from above.

477
00:36:40,720 --> 00:36:42,040
From whom?

478
00:36:42,120 --> 00:36:43,840
From above.

479
00:36:45,240 --> 00:36:46,280
Maybe Lord Indra himself.

480
00:36:52,240 --> 00:36:53,920
I said you can't go in!

481
00:36:54,520 --> 00:36:56,200
I'm the one who gave Chamoi the order.

482
00:36:56,720 --> 00:37:00,200
Your job is to take care of customers. Go to the model home.

483
00:37:01,040 --> 00:37:03,080
I really need to talk to Grandpa.

484
00:37:04,280 --> 00:37:06,640
I'm responsible for taking care of Father.

485
00:37:06,720 --> 00:37:08,480
If you have something to say, tell me.

486
00:37:08,560 --> 00:37:11,960
I'll decide whether it's important enough to bother him with.

487
00:37:12,040 --> 00:37:15,840
And you should know that you cause trouble every single day.

488
00:37:15,920 --> 00:37:19,080
You keep putting him under so much stress

489
00:37:19,160 --> 00:37:21,200
that one day he'll probably have a stroke. Well?

490
00:37:22,120 --> 00:37:24,320
If you have nothing to say, go back to work.

491
00:37:24,400 --> 00:37:25,960
‎STARTS FROM 6.9 MILLION BAHT

492
00:37:26,040 --> 00:37:29,240
Then please tell Grandpa

493
00:37:29,320 --> 00:37:31,720
that Ramil is sick and needs to take the day off.

494
00:37:31,800 --> 00:37:35,560
How can he do that? You know Father is rushing to finish construction.

495
00:37:35,640 --> 00:37:39,600
Buyers are lined up to close, but he's completely unreliable.

496
00:37:40,920 --> 00:37:42,880
Ramil really is sick, Aunt Liu.

497
00:37:43,480 --> 00:37:46,040
You've barely started living together

498
00:37:46,120 --> 00:37:47,640
and you're already defending him.

499
00:37:48,160 --> 00:37:50,120
Still in the honeymoon phase, are you?

500
00:37:50,200 --> 00:37:52,600
Then take the day off and go look after your husband too.

501
00:37:52,680 --> 00:37:54,720
Or better yet, just quit.

502
00:37:55,680 --> 00:37:57,680
That's all I needed to say.

503
00:37:57,760 --> 00:38:01,640
I'll get back to work now. I really don't have time to argue.

504
00:38:04,880 --> 00:38:07,600
Madam, she was taking a jab at you.

505
00:38:07,680 --> 00:38:08,920
I know.

506
00:38:09,840 --> 00:38:12,280
You picked the wrong person to mess with, Hathaya.

507
00:38:13,160 --> 00:38:15,560
‎Madam, what are you going to do?

508
00:38:30,560 --> 00:38:33,920
Father! Father! This is terrible!

509
00:38:35,400 --> 00:38:36,720
What is it now?

510
00:38:36,800 --> 00:38:39,480
It's Ramil. He's slacking off. He refuses to come to work.

511
00:38:40,080 --> 00:38:41,920
You're in the office. How would you know?

512
00:38:43,720 --> 00:38:48,240
I know you need the houses completed in time for the transfers,

513
00:38:48,320 --> 00:38:50,520
so I went to inspect the site for you,

514
00:38:50,600 --> 00:38:53,120
but Ramil wasn't there supervising.

515
00:38:53,200 --> 00:38:57,000
His workers were all over the place. Everything was a complete mess.

516
00:38:57,080 --> 00:38:58,920
When the workers don't see their supervisor

517
00:38:59,000 --> 00:39:00,440
because he's taken the day off,

518
00:39:00,520 --> 00:39:03,640
no one does anything.

519
00:39:03,720 --> 00:39:06,360
They just slack off and sit around all day, sir.

520
00:39:07,320 --> 00:39:10,720
Father, I warned you

521
00:39:10,800 --> 00:39:12,840
not to trust Ramil.

522
00:39:12,920 --> 00:39:15,040
Once he realized you trusted him,

523
00:39:15,120 --> 00:39:19,720
he got comfortable. He doesn't care how much damage it causes your project.

524
00:39:20,600 --> 00:39:22,000
All right.

525
00:39:22,080 --> 00:39:24,560
If you have work to do, go do it. I'll handle this myself.

526
00:39:24,640 --> 00:39:26,880
Father, I don't know

527
00:39:26,960 --> 00:39:29,720
how long Ramil plans to keep slacking off.

528
00:39:30,240 --> 00:39:31,920
You need a backup plan.

529
00:39:36,080 --> 00:39:37,200
What do you want me to do?

530
00:39:37,880 --> 00:39:39,120
Father,

531
00:39:39,800 --> 00:39:43,120
Pong used to be a construction contractor.

532
00:39:43,640 --> 00:39:46,480
Bring him in to help supervise the project too.

533
00:39:47,000 --> 00:39:49,840
I'm sure your development

534
00:39:49,920 --> 00:39:52,240
will be completed on schedule.

535
00:39:56,360 --> 00:39:59,640
Then have Pong start tomorrow.

536
00:40:01,320 --> 00:40:02,200
Yes.

537
00:40:06,880 --> 00:40:10,280
Hey. I brought you some rice porridge.

538
00:40:20,320 --> 00:40:23,680
How are you feeling? Are you very sick?

539
00:40:23,760 --> 00:40:25,000
Want me to take you to a doctor?

540
00:40:27,680 --> 00:40:28,920
I'm just tired.

541
00:40:31,560 --> 00:40:33,280
Then why did you skip work?

542
00:40:34,280 --> 00:40:35,320
I wanted to rest.

543
00:40:38,240 --> 00:40:40,200
I understand that you're upset.

544
00:40:40,800 --> 00:40:43,760
So rest as much as you need today.

545
00:40:44,600 --> 00:40:46,360
So you'll have the energy to work tomorrow.

546
00:40:46,880 --> 00:40:47,720
And…

547
00:40:48,920 --> 00:40:51,600
I brought you some rice porridge. It's on the table.

548
00:41:03,280 --> 00:41:05,560
How many more days is your boss staying home from work?

549
00:41:06,080 --> 00:41:07,400
I honestly couldn't tell you.

550
00:41:08,120 --> 00:41:10,000
My boss is impossible to read.

551
00:41:10,520 --> 00:41:14,000
He's upset, but he needs to leave personal issues out of work.

552
00:41:14,080 --> 00:41:16,800
If he keeps staying home, there's going to be trouble.

553
00:41:18,120 --> 00:41:20,800
Everyone! Gather over here!

554
00:41:21,840 --> 00:41:23,760
Move! Hurry!

555
00:41:28,360 --> 00:41:31,120
Come on! Faster! How disappointing.

556
00:41:32,360 --> 00:41:33,960
Aunt Chamoi, why did you call them over?

557
00:41:34,040 --> 00:41:36,080
I respectfully decline to answer

558
00:41:36,160 --> 00:41:39,600
because you are not my boss.

559
00:41:39,680 --> 00:41:41,960
Then who told everyone to come here?

560
00:41:42,720 --> 00:41:43,840
I did.

561
00:41:47,720 --> 00:41:49,440
Aunt Liu, why did you call them over?

562
00:41:49,520 --> 00:41:51,840
I have an announcement for all of you.

563
00:41:52,360 --> 00:41:55,520
From now on, you'll have a new foreman

564
00:41:55,600 --> 00:41:57,040
supervising your work.

565
00:41:57,120 --> 00:41:59,720
But Ramil already supervises us.

566
00:42:00,320 --> 00:42:03,000
That's right. And he takes good care of us.

567
00:42:03,600 --> 00:42:06,920
He's been nowhere to be seen for days. He hasn't even shown up today.

568
00:42:07,000 --> 00:42:09,200
And you call that a good supervisor?

569
00:42:12,480 --> 00:42:14,440
I called all of you here

570
00:42:14,520 --> 00:42:18,360
to introduce your new supervisor.

571
00:42:28,200 --> 00:42:31,240
My name is Pong. I'll be supervising all of you from now on.

572
00:42:32,720 --> 00:42:35,280
So work hard.

573
00:42:35,360 --> 00:42:37,840
If anyone slacks off or gets lazy,

574
00:42:38,880 --> 00:42:39,840
I'll dock your pay.

575
00:42:42,920 --> 00:42:45,760
Now that you've met him, get back to work. Go!

576
00:42:46,400 --> 00:42:48,880
Remember!

577
00:42:48,960 --> 00:42:52,680
Anyone who slacks off, gets lazy, or causes damage

578
00:42:52,760 --> 00:42:53,800
gets their pay docked!

579
00:42:55,600 --> 00:42:56,640
What is this?

580
00:42:56,720 --> 00:42:58,320
It's…

581
00:42:58,400 --> 00:43:00,800
It's fine. Everyone, go.

582
00:43:00,880 --> 00:43:02,520
Get back to work.

583
00:43:07,400 --> 00:43:08,360
Here, Madam.

584
00:43:09,680 --> 00:43:11,120
Hello, Miss Hathaya.

585
00:43:12,120 --> 00:43:13,080
Glad we'll be working together.

586
00:43:18,480 --> 00:43:19,320
Hello.

587
00:43:22,480 --> 00:43:24,960
Then I'll get back to work.

588
00:43:26,400 --> 00:43:29,360
Next time, perhaps we'll get to know each other better.

589
00:43:35,160 --> 00:43:36,040
Madam.

590
00:43:37,160 --> 00:43:38,000
Hey.

591
00:43:39,000 --> 00:43:43,280
If your husband keeps taking time off, you'd better get ready to quit too.

592
00:43:59,960 --> 00:44:01,520
Good. Good.

593
00:44:01,600 --> 00:44:03,280
Faster! You must work faster.

594
00:44:03,360 --> 00:44:04,320
Ugh.

595
00:44:04,960 --> 00:44:06,760
You're moving at a snail's pace.

596
00:44:07,360 --> 00:44:10,080
Come on, you guys!

597
00:44:10,600 --> 00:44:11,840
Faster!

598
00:44:11,920 --> 00:44:13,040
Damn it!

599
00:44:17,240 --> 00:44:18,080
You okay?

600
00:44:18,160 --> 00:44:19,760
Hey! Stop!

601
00:44:20,640 --> 00:44:23,440
Don't help her. If she can fall down, she can get herself back up.

602
00:44:24,960 --> 00:44:26,320
If she can't handle it, she can quit.

603
00:44:26,400 --> 00:44:28,440
Are you deaf?

604
00:44:28,520 --> 00:44:30,000
I said don't help her.

605
00:44:36,240 --> 00:44:38,800
Come on. You got this?

606
00:44:39,440 --> 00:44:40,400
Hey, kid.

607
00:44:40,920 --> 00:44:42,400
Don't help him.

608
00:44:42,480 --> 00:44:44,720
Go find something else to do.

609
00:44:46,320 --> 00:44:47,800
Are you deaf?

610
00:44:48,680 --> 00:44:50,800
Those bricks. Over there. Yeah.

611
00:44:52,240 --> 00:44:53,280
Got nothing better to do?

612
00:44:55,680 --> 00:44:56,600
Still?

613
00:44:57,760 --> 00:44:59,840
If the new supervisor is this harsh,

614
00:44:59,920 --> 00:45:01,160
the workers won't last long.

615
00:45:04,320 --> 00:45:08,440
I'll have to leave this to you, Max. I need to go take care of the customers.

616
00:45:08,520 --> 00:45:09,560
Sure.

617
00:45:09,640 --> 00:45:10,640
Keep an eye on things.

618
00:45:15,800 --> 00:45:17,240
Would you like to reserve one?

619
00:45:18,160 --> 00:45:21,200
I'm planning to move here from another province.

620
00:45:21,760 --> 00:45:23,240
Are you sure it'll be done on time?

621
00:45:23,320 --> 00:45:24,960
We're doing all we can to wrap this up.

622
00:45:25,480 --> 00:45:26,800
When I drove in just now,

623
00:45:27,320 --> 00:45:30,960
the site looked unfinished, unlike the other development near the entrance.

624
00:45:31,480 --> 00:45:32,720
I'll go with that one instead.

625
00:45:33,760 --> 00:45:34,920
Thank you.

626
00:46:06,200 --> 00:46:09,320
You're better now. Come to work tomorrow.

627
00:46:09,960 --> 00:46:11,200
I'm still not ready tomorrow.

628
00:46:13,560 --> 00:46:14,880
When will you be ready?

629
00:46:14,960 --> 00:46:16,160
I don't know.

630
00:46:17,080 --> 00:46:21,480
Maybe two or three days.

631
00:46:21,560 --> 00:46:22,400
Maybe a week.

632
00:46:23,400 --> 00:46:25,360
Then don't go back to work at all.

633
00:46:26,720 --> 00:46:29,400
Quit. Take the rest of your life off.

634
00:46:33,200 --> 00:46:35,760
I told you not to be sarcastic with me.

635
00:46:36,640 --> 00:46:39,160
And what do you call what you're doing?

636
00:46:40,040 --> 00:46:42,400
Whatever I do has nothing to do with you.

637
00:46:44,600 --> 00:46:47,560
Why are you looking at me like that? What's your problem?

638
00:46:48,160 --> 00:46:51,680
You're always criticizing everyone else for being selfish,

639
00:46:51,760 --> 00:46:53,840
but you never look at yourself.

640
00:46:53,920 --> 00:46:55,920
You're being just as selfish as they are.

641
00:46:56,000 --> 00:46:57,200
I've never been selfish.

642
00:46:57,280 --> 00:46:59,200
Then what do you call this?

643
00:47:00,520 --> 00:47:04,280
You should realize how much trouble

644
00:47:04,360 --> 00:47:06,480
your behavior is causing the workers.

645
00:47:10,560 --> 00:47:13,360
Aunt Liu brought Pong in to supervise the work instead of you.

646
00:47:14,120 --> 00:47:15,880
Grandpa saw that you weren't coming to work,

647
00:47:16,640 --> 00:47:18,400
so he had no choice but to agree.

648
00:47:20,160 --> 00:47:22,600
Pong abuses his authority over the workers.

649
00:47:22,680 --> 00:47:25,720
He made a rule that anyone who gets lazy,

650
00:47:25,800 --> 00:47:29,880
slacks off, makes a mistake, or damages anything

651
00:47:30,520 --> 00:47:31,760
will have their pay docked.

652
00:47:34,080 --> 00:47:35,560
If this keeps going,

653
00:47:36,360 --> 00:47:38,720
the workers will start quitting.

654
00:47:38,800 --> 00:47:40,320
Then my sales work will suffer too.

655
00:47:41,240 --> 00:47:45,280
I can't tell buyers if their house will be ready on time,

656
00:47:45,360 --> 00:47:47,480
and they'll go buy from other developments instead.

657
00:47:48,640 --> 00:47:49,720
So after all that,

658
00:47:50,640 --> 00:47:51,880
you're just worried about yourself.

659
00:47:51,960 --> 00:47:55,120
If I only cared about myself, I wouldn't care about any of this.

660
00:47:55,200 --> 00:47:57,160
I wouldn't waste my time talking to you.

661
00:47:59,120 --> 00:48:02,120
I have a grandmother to take care of. I have responsibilities.

662
00:48:02,200 --> 00:48:04,520
I have goals I need to meet at work.

663
00:48:05,240 --> 00:48:07,840
I need that money to support my family.

664
00:48:11,120 --> 00:48:14,640
And no matter how bad my personal problems get,

665
00:48:14,720 --> 00:48:18,280
I would never let them hurt other people the way you are.

666
00:48:21,160 --> 00:48:22,840
Don't act like my mother

667
00:48:23,360 --> 00:48:24,840
and lecture me.

668
00:48:26,000 --> 00:48:27,160
Or have you forgotten?

669
00:48:28,120 --> 00:48:30,120
Just because you live here as my wife, you think

670
00:48:30,920 --> 00:48:33,840
-you can push your husband around? -Don't be crude with me.

671
00:48:33,920 --> 00:48:35,240
I'm not your wife.

672
00:48:35,840 --> 00:48:38,720
Everyone already believes we slept together.

673
00:48:40,040 --> 00:48:41,720
People are already gossiping about us anyway.

674
00:48:42,560 --> 00:48:44,000
We might as well actually do it.

675
00:48:45,480 --> 00:48:47,520
Don't act so disgusting with me.

676
00:48:48,080 --> 00:48:50,360
What? You think you're so good?

677
00:48:51,600 --> 00:48:53,800
The little angel adored by the common people.

678
00:48:54,320 --> 00:48:56,440
I would never take someone like you as my wife!

679
00:49:05,280 --> 00:49:06,520
Ms. Liu, whatever you want,

680
00:49:06,600 --> 00:49:09,160
however you want it done, I can make it happen.

681
00:49:09,240 --> 00:49:10,480
You talking back to me?!

682
00:49:10,560 --> 00:49:11,880
Stay out of it!

683
00:49:12,480 --> 00:49:15,560
It's Ramil. He's been absent from work, causing all these problems,

684
00:49:15,640 --> 00:49:18,760
and he's even been stirring up the workers to turn against Pong.

685
00:49:18,840 --> 00:49:20,640
NEXT EPISODE

686
00:49:20,720 --> 00:49:23,880
Ever since you moved into this house,

687
00:49:24,400 --> 00:49:26,840
you've become a lot more vulgar yourself.

688
00:49:26,920 --> 00:49:27,800
Here.

689
00:49:29,360 --> 00:49:31,160
If you didn't want Raiwin to have a girlfriend,

690
00:49:31,240 --> 00:49:32,920
why did you tell him to pursue Hathaya?

691
00:49:33,000 --> 00:49:35,080
Because Hathaya is better than you.

692
00:51:32,640 --> 00:51:34,560
Subtitle translation by: Thanit Puncharoen
